UPDATE companies SET description='Stuke Iowa operates from Houghton, Iowa, where it was established in 1992 as the U.S. subsidiary of the German Stuekerjuergen Group, a plastics engineering company founded in 1967. The business remains family-owned and is led by General Manager Frank Stuekerjuergen.

The roughly 30,000-square-foot facility provides custom plastic parts and profiles through extrusion, injection molding, and 3D printing (additive manufacturing for ABS, PC, and PEI/Ultem).

Stuke Iowa serves customers in agriculture, construction, food processing, technical equipment, and aerospace. References are limited by non-disclosure agreements, but the company notes long-standing relationships spanning more than 25 years in these sectors.

