UPDATE companies SET description='Summit Plastic Molding was founded in 1982 in Shelby Township, Michigan, initially operating as a tool shop. The company later expanded into a full-service injection molding supplier, adding manufacturing capabilities alongside its tooling expertise. No founders are named in public materials, and ownership structure is not disclosed.

The company provides prototype and production injection molding with press capacities ranging from 85 to 1,000 tons.

Summit serves the automotive, medical, and defense sectors, delivering molded components for applications in each industry. The firm does not publicly list specific customers.

