UPDATE companies SET description='SunSpark Technology, based in Hemet, California, was founded in 2008. The company operates as a manufacturer of solar photovoltaic modules.

The company produces thin-film photovoltaic panels using cadmium telluride technology, as well as monocrystalline and polycrystalline PV panels. Solar modules are built with tempered glass and anodized aluminum frames.

SunSpark serves commercial, industrial, military, government, and residential customers. The company’s client base spans both public and private sector projects.

