UPDATE companies SET description='SunGold Foods Inc., a division of Red River Commodities, operates from Fargo, North Dakota. The company specializes in producing roasted ingredients and food products tailored to customer formulations and specifications, along with custom packaging solutions.

The facility roasts products using both oil frying and dry roasting methods. For frying, it employs NuSun sunflower oil, a trans-fat-free oil with minimal flavor transfer. Dry roasting is performed in multiple configurations to achieve distinct flavor profiles. The company''s roasting lines are designed for continuous flow, reducing variation in finished goods. Master Roasters oversee each batch to meet taste, texture, and visual requirements. SunGold also develops custom flavors and proprietary pre-blends in collaboration with clients, and maintains a completely peanut- and tree nut-free environment.

SunGold serves food manufacturers and brands that require custom-roasted ingredients, particularly those needing nut-free and allergen-controlled products. Its quality system monitors every step from seed selection and planting through harvest, storage, processing, packaging, and delivery. On-site testing includes moisture, color, salt levels, residual oxygen, bag weights, coding, seal integrity, and package appearance. Nitrogen flushing is used to remove oxygen from packages and prevent oxidation.

The company holds AIB, Kosher, Organic, and SQF Food Safety certifications, reflecting its focus on human food standards, high purity, and identity preservation. These certifications, combined with its science-based roasting approach and dedicated Master Roasters, form the basis of its differentiation in the custom roasting and packaging market.', certifications=ARRAY['AIB','Kosher Certified','Organic Certified','SQF: Food Safety Certified']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom roasting (oil frying and dry roasting)", "Custom packaging solutions", "Flavor development", "Proprietary pre-blend formulation", "Quality assurance and testing (moisture, color, salt)", "Nitrogen flush packaging", "Identity preservation and traceability", "Integrated supply chain monitoring (seed to delivery)"], "industries": ["Human food manufacturing", "Allergen-free food"], "materials": ["Sunflower seeds", "Sunflower kernels", "Specialty agricultural commodities", "NuSun sunflower oil"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Completely nut-free facility", "Science-based continuous-flow roasting lines", "Master Roasters ensure sensory specifications", "NuSun sunflower oil (trans-fat-free) for frying", "Nitrogen flush packaging to prevent oxidation", "Certifications: AIB, Kosher, Organic, SQF"], "facts_used": ["Location: Fargo, North Dakota -> db", "Division of Red River Commodities -> main page", "Creates roasted ingredients and food products to meet specific formulations -> main page", "Custom packaging solutions -> main page", "Roasting via oil frying using NuSun sunflower oil -> main page", "Dry roasting in multiple configurations -> main page", "Continuous flow roasting lines reduce variation -> main page", "Master Roasters oversee taste, texture, visual requirements -> main page", "Custom flavor development -> main page", "Proprietary pre-blend formulation -> main page", "Completely peanut- and tree nut-free facility -> main page", "Qua