UPDATE companies SET description='Sunny Side Solutions is a solar installation and electrical contracting company based in Prior Lake, Minnesota. The firm operates as a full-service electrical contractor specializing in solar energy systems for residential and commercial customers across the state.

The company provides end-to-end solar services, handling system design, permitting, installation, and final inspection in-house. Its offerings include residential and commercial solar array installation on pitched roofs, flat roofs, and ground-mounted configurations, as well as battery energy storage systems, electric vehicle charging stations, and electrical panel upgrades. A dedicated remove-and-replace service supports roof replacements, remodeling projects, system upgrades, and insurance claims, with crews coordinating directly with roofing contractors and insurers.

Sunny Side Solutions serves homeowners, builders, and insurance companies throughout Minneapolis, Saint Paul, and greater Minnesota. Its commercial client base spans farms, retail locations, and industrial facilities, with scalable systems tailored to each property’s energy usage and roof type.

The company emphasizes a safety-first, code-compliant approach, with a master licensed electrician overseeing every project. By managing all phases internally—from engineering to utility coordination—Sunny Side Solutions aims to deliver a smooth, reliable experience and long-term system performance.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Residential solar installation", "Commercial solar installation", "Solar panel removal and reinstallation", "Pitched roof solar array installation", "Ground mount solar installation", "Flat roof solar array installation", "Battery energy storage system installation", "EV charging station installation", "Electrical panel upgrades", "System design and permitting", "Installation and final inspection"], "industries": ["Residential", "Commercial", "Industrial", "Agricultural", "Retail", "Insurance"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["In-house design, permitting, installation, and inspection", "Master licensed electrician on staff", "Code-compliant, safety-focused installations", "Specialized solar panel removal and reinstallation for roof replacements and insurance claims", "Integrated solar, battery storage, and EV charging solutions"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Prior Lake, Minnesota -> db", "Full-service electrical contractor specializing in solar installations -> /about", "Services: residential solar installation, commercial solar installation, remove & replace, pitched roof, ground mount, flat roof, battery storage, EV charging, electrical panel upgrades -> /", "Customer types: homeowners, builders, insurers, farms, retail locations, industrial facilities -> /", "In-house design, permitting, installation, inspection -> /about", "Master licensed electrician on staff -> /", "Code-compliant, long-term performance focus -> /about", "End-to-end service from permitting to activation -> /"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_product