UPDATE companies SET description='Sunnyside Solar operates from Guilford, Vermont. The company was founded by solar pioneers Richard Gottlieb and Carol Levin and has remained family-owned through multiple ownership transitions. After four years in a barn near Chelsea Royal, the business relocated to its current Guilford location under the stewardship of Joseph and Rosemary Mangum.

The firm designs and installs solar electric systems, including utility grid-connected arrays, off-grid applications, battery backup storage, and LED lighting. It also sources used-but-reputable equipment to keep projects affordable. Sunnyside Solar serves customers across Vermont, New England, and beyond, handling projects from initial site assessment through final commissioning.

Its clientele includes homeowners seeking grid-tied systems, property owners pursuing off-grid independence, and clients adding battery storage for resilience. The company emphasizes proper system sizing for each situation, whether the goal is reducing utility bills, achieving energy autonomy, or simply experimenting with solar.

Sunnyside Solar distinguishes itself by designing "by need, not greed," prioritizing sustainability and energy awareness over upselling. The owners’ personal commitment to homesteading and environmental stewardship informs a mission to protect air, water, and forests for future generations.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Solar panel installation", "Grid-tied solar system design and installation", "Off-grid solar system design and installation", "Battery backup system installation", "LED lighting installation", "Solar electric system design", "Clean energy storage solutions"], "industries": ["Solar energy", "Renewable energy", "Off-grid power systems"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Design by need, not greed", "Family-owned and operated", "Offers used-but-reputable equipment for affordability", "Focus on sustainability and energy awareness", "Properly sized systems for optimal return on investment"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters: Guilford, VT -> db", "Founders: Richard Gottlieb and Carol Levin -> /about", "Family-owned business -> /about", "Relocated to Guilford after four years in barn near Chelsea Royal -> /about", "Current owners: Joseph and Rosemary Mangum -> /about", "Capabilities: solar panel installation, grid-tied, off-grid, battery backup -> db", "Also offers LED lighting and clean storage options -> /about", "Design philosophy: ''design by need, not greed'' -> /about", "Offers used-but-reputable equipment for affordability -> /", "Focus on sustainability and energy awareness -> /", "Properly sized systems for best ROI -> /", "Serves Vermont, New England, and beyond -> /about"], "company_type": "Installer / service company", "makes_products": "no", "type_evidence": "We design and install Solar Electric Utility Grid Connected Off-Grid Applications Clean Storage Options LED Lighting", "founded_year": "", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "exp