UPDATE companies SET description='Sustainable Island Products is a family-owned wholesale distributor headquartered in Kailua-Kona on the island of Hawaii. The business is co-owned by John Elkjer, who serves as CEO, and Julie Elkjer, president, and operates as a family-run enterprise serving the entire Hawaiian chain.

From five warehouses spread across the state, the company supplies compostable packaging, glass containers, and post-consumer paper products to food-service businesses of every scale. Statewide delivery logistics allow it to reach customers on Hawaii, Maui, Oahu, Kauai, Molokai, and Lanai.

