UPDATE companies SET description='Switchgear Resources, Inc. (SRi) was founded in 2014 in Arlington, Texas. The company describes itself as an engineering and manufacturing firm with over 90 years of collective experience among its team.

SRi designs and builds medium‑voltage metal‑clad switchgear rated from 2.4 kV to 38 kV, including draw‑out vacuum circuit breakers, draw‑out instrument transformer compartments, relay panels, mimic panels, and accessories such as lift trucks and circuit‑breaker garages. Production is handled in‑house: the shop fabricates copper bus, steel frames, custom insulators, and acrylic one‑line diagrams using a layered acrylic deposition process, an epoxy‑coated bus line, a CNC routing machine, and a 10‑ton gantry crane. Design work relies on 3D mechanical modeling and automated electrical design tools.

SRi’s customer list spans North American energy and industrial sectors, with named references including Siemens, Baker Hughes, Chevron Phillips, Dominion Energy, Avista Utilities, and several midstream and petrochemical operators. These accounts indicate a focus on oil‑and‑gas, utility, and heavy‑industrial applications.

The firm positions itself on two differentiators: delivering custom switchgear in roughly half the industry’s typical lead time, and pioneering full‑remote lockout/tagout capability for medium‑voltage gear. Its front‑access, wall‑mounted designs aim to eliminate rear service clearances, and its compact voltage‑transformer drawers reduce overall equipment height.', certifications=ARRAY['ANSI']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Medium\u2011voltage metal\u2011clad switchgear manufacturing", "Draw\u2011out vacuum circuit breaker integration", "Draw\u2011out instrument transformer compartment manufacturing", "Custom switchgear design (3D mechanical modeling, automated electrical design)", "Copper bus fabrication", "Steel frame fabrication", "Custom insulator manufacturing", "Acrylic one\u2011line diagram production (layered acrylic deposition)", "Epoxy\u2011coated bus processing", "CNC routing", "Relay panel assembly", "Mimic panel laser engraving", "Ground\u2011on\u2011command system integration", "Switchgear accessory fabrication (lift truck, circuit breaker garage)"], "industries": [], "materials": ["Copper", "Steel", "Custom insulators", "Acrylic", "Epoxy"], "equipment": ["Layered acrylic deposition system", "In\u2011house medium\u2011voltage epoxy coated bus process", "CNC routing machine", "10\u2011ton gantry crane"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Custom switchgear delivered in half the industry\u2019s typical lead time", "Pioneer in full\u2011remote lockout/tagout for medium\u2011voltage switchgear", "Front\u2011access, wall\u2011mounted designs that eliminate rear service clearances", "Most compact draw\u2011out voltage\u2011transformer compartments on the market", "In\u2011house fabrication of copper bus, steel frames, insulators, and acrylic mimics"], "facts_used": ["Founded 2014 -> db, /about-us", "Headquarters Arlington, Texas -> db", "Manufactures medium voltage switchgear 2.4kV-38kV -> /", "In-house manufacturing of coppe