UPDATE companies SET description='Syscom Tech was founded in 1998 in Moorestown, New Jersey, to fill a gap for reliable, U.S.-based contract manufacturing. What began as a small operation focused exclusively on cable and wire harness assemblies has grown into a full-service electronics manufacturer. The company is a second-generation family business and a veteran-owned small business.

Today Syscom Tech operates a 36,000-square-foot facility equipped with three SMT lines running 24/5. It provides turnkey printed circuit board assembly — including ultra-miniature 01005 placement, through-hole, mixed-technology, and lead-free/RoHS-compliant processes — as well as custom cable and wire harness fabrication and electromechanical box-build integration. The shop handles projects from new product introduction through full-scale production.

The company serves aerospace, defense, transportation, medical, industrial, and automotive customers, many in regulated sectors that require AS9100D and ISO 9001:2015 compliance. Its client base includes legacy cable-harness accounts as well as new programs requiring complex multi-layer and flex-circuit assemblies.

Syscom Tech emphasizes its U.S.-based manufacturing, full traceability on every component and process, and a modular floor configuration that allows flexible, concurrent project execution. The veteran-owned leadership cites a mission-driven commitment to precision, accountability, and client satisfaction as the foundation of its operation.', certifications=ARRAY['AS9100D','ISO 9001:2015','RoHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Printed Circuit Board Assembly (PCBA)", "Surface Mount Technology (SMT) Assembly", "Through-Hole Assembly", "Mixed Technology Assembly", "Lead-Free and RoHS-Compliant Assembly", "Ultra-miniature 01005 Component Placement", "Complex Multi-layer Board Assembly", "Flex Circuit Assembly", "New Product Introduction (NPI)", "High-Volume Production", "Cable & Wire Harness Assembly", "Custom Cable and Wire Harness Fabrication", "Electromechanical Assembly", "Box Build Integration", "Full Turnkey Manufacturing", "Component Sourcing", "Final Inspection and Testing", "Full Traceability", "Value-Added Services"], "industries": ["Aerospace", "Defense", "Transportation", "Medical", "Industrial", "Automotive"], "materials": [], "equipment": ["Three SMT lines"], "volume": "NPI to full-scale production", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["AS9100D & ISO 9001:2015 certified quality management", "All production in a 36,000 sq ft Moorestown, NJ facility", "Turnkey solutions from component sourcing to final inspection", "Full traceability on every component and process", "Three SMT lines operating 24/5 with flexible floor configurations"], "facts_used": ["Founded in 1998 -> /", "Moorestown, NJ facility -> /", "36,000 sqft facility -> /", "Second-generation family business -> /", "Veteran-owned small business -> /about", "AS9100D & ISO 9001:2015 certified -> /", "Three SMT lines 24/5 -> /", "Turnkey solutions from sourcing to final inspection -> /", "Full traceability -> /", "Industries: aerospace, defense, transportation, medical, industrial -> /