UPDATE companies SET description='Systems Wire & Cable Ltd was founded in 1986 in Los Angeles, California. The company traces its inception to 1985, when it began with a commitment to quality in custom cable manufacturing.

The company designs, develops, and manufactures custom electronic cable and wire, including bonded wire, low-noise cable, medical leads and trunk cables, military-spec constructions, and Alpha and Belden equivalents. Processes cover custom cable application design, thermal bonding, adhesive-free bonding, overmolding, and full UL/CSA lab testing. A complete UL/CSA laboratory operates on site.

Customers span medical device OEMs (patient lead wires, hospital equipment cable), military programs (mil-spec cables), computer and communications equipment makers, and industrial OEMs. The firm also supplies overmolders and offers free consulting on cable design.

Systems Wire & Cable emphasizes on-spec, on-time, and on-budget delivery, often shipping days before due dates. Its "Commitment to Quality" principle, maintained since inception, underpins its reputation in medical and industrial markets. The company positions itself as a pioneer with over 40 years of experience.', certifications=ARRAY['RoHS','REACH','UL','CSA','AAMI']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom cable manufacturing", "Bonded wire manufacturing", "Thermal bonding", "Adhesive-free bonding", "Low noise cable production", "Medical wire and cable manufacturing", "Military spec cable manufacturing", "Custom cable application design", "UL/CSA lab testing", "Overmolding", "Shielded cable production", "Twisted pair cable production", "Control cable manufacturing", "Ribbon cable manufacturing", "Flat wire production", "Tinsel wire manufacturing", "Coaxial cable production", "Patient lead wire manufacturing", "Medical trunk cable manufacturing", "Hospital equipment cable manufacturing", "OEM manufacturing", "Alpha cable equivalents", "Belden cable equivalents"], "industries": ["Medical", "Military", "Computer", "Communications", "Industrial", "OEM manufacturing"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["On-time delivery days before due dates", "Free consulting in a non-rushed environment", "Complete UL/CSA lab on site", "Adhesive-free bonding technology"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1986 -> db", "Headquarters Los Angeles, CA -> db", "Inception 1985, commitment to quality -> /", "Custom cable manufacturer, bonded wire, low noise cable, medical, military -> /", "Processes: custom design, thermal bonding, adhesive-free bonding, overmolding, UL/CSA lab -> /", "Industries: medical, military, computer, communications, industrial -> /", "Certifications: RoHS/REACH, UL/CSA, AAMI, ISO pending -> /", "On-time, on-budget, free consulting -> /", "LinkedIn URL -> db"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "