UPDATE companies SET description='T & M Enterprises Inc was founded in 1984 in Shaftsbury, Vermont, and operates as an SBA-certified HUBZone small business.

The company specializes in moderate- to high-volume injection molding of small plastic parts, running presses up to 176 tons capable of producing parts with a 50-square-inch parting line or weighing less than 12 ounces. It also operates a dedicated plastic extrusion line for cut-to-length winding cores used in the capacitor industry. The 30,000-square-foot facility houses Battenfeld molding centers, warehousing space, and a just-in-time delivery program that stocks parts to blanket orders.

While capable of serving any industry, T & M Enterprises focuses primarily on the electrical and medical sectors, with additional work for the capacitor market. Named customers include Mace Personal Defense Inc. and Ronken Industries, and the company ships throughout the United States and Mexico from its Southern Vermont location.

The company highlights its 100% solar-powered operation, ISO 9001 quality certification, and a policy of not marking up tool-and-die costs passed through from mold makers. Its HUBZone status and just-in-time warehousing are also cited as differentiators.', certifications=ARRAY['ISO 9001','HUBZone']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom plastic injection molding", "Plastic extrusion (cut-to-length winding cores)", "Warehousing", "Just-in-time delivery", "Quality control (ISO 9001)", "Tool and die coordination"], "industries": ["Electrical", "Medical", "Capacitor", "Personal Defense"], "materials": ["PVC", "PEEK", "Thermoplastics"], "equipment": ["Battenfeld molding centers", "176-ton injection molding press", "Plastic extrusion line"], "volume": "Moderate to high volume", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% solar-powered facility", "ISO 9001 certified quality system", "No markup on tool-and-die costs", "Just-in-time delivery and warehousing", "HUBZone certified small business"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1984 -> db", "Headquarters Shaftsbury, Vermont -> db", "HUBZone certified -> db", "ISO 9001 certified -> page /", "30,000 sq ft facility -> page /", "176-ton largest press -> page /", "Plastic extrusion line for cut-to-length winding cores -> page /", "Just-in-time delivery and warehousing -> page /", "100% solar powered -> page /", "No markup on tool and die costs -> page /", "Predominantly electrical and medical industries -> page /", "Customers include Mace Personal Defense Inc. and Ronken Industries -> db", "Battenfeld molding centers -> page /", "Serves U.S. and Mexico -> page /"], "company_type": "Contract manufacturer / job shop", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evidence": "T&M Enterprises specialized in custom plastic injection molding specializing in moderate to high volume small plastic part runs.", "founded_year": "1984", "employee_count": "", "cage_code": "", "min_order": "", "export_compliance": [], "languages": [], "social_links": [