UPDATE companies SET description='TRC Electronics, Inc. was founded on April 16, 1982, in Lodi, New Jersey, as a privately-held company providing troubleshooting, repair, and calibration services for power supplies to OEMs. The company later moved its main distribution center to Doylestown, Pennsylvania, near Philadelphia.

Today, TRC operates as a franchised distributor specializing exclusively in power supply products and components. It maintains one of the largest power supply inventories in the United States at its Doylestown warehouse, where in-stock orders placed before 3:30 PM EST ship the same day. The company offers value-added services including testing and troubleshooting of customer systems, a MEAN WELL USA authorized repair center, modular power supply configuration for MEAN WELL and Enedo lines (with one-business-day turnaround), and custom packaging and labeling. Its engineering team, trained directly by manufacturers, supports design and compliance across medical, LED, and industrial applications.

Customers include engineers validating new designs through the company''s engineering sample program, as well as buyers and planners who rely on its forecasting and lead-time management. The distributor carries brands such as MEAN WELL, TRACO Power, Delta Electronics, BUD Industries, Power Sonic, and Hammond Manufacturing.

The company was established to provide specialized power supply expertise—troubleshooting, repair, and calibration—that generalist distributors could not offer. Its mission to "supply businesses the power to succeed" reflects a focus on technical depth, inventory availability, and authorized service capabilities that differentiate it from broader-line distributors.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Power supply distribution", "Engineering support for power supply applications", "Testing and troubleshooting of customer systems", "MEAN WELL authorized repair service", "Modular power supply configuration (MEAN WELL and Enedo)", "Custom packaging and labeling", "Same-day shipping for in-stock orders", "Volume discount programs", "Inventory management and forecasting", "Engineering sample program for qualified projects"], "industries": ["Medical", "LED Lighting", "Industrial", "Automation", "Renewable Energy", "Security", "Emergency Lighting", "Electric Vehicles"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Same-day shipping for in-stock orders placed before 3:30 PM EST; 1 business day for custom modular power supply configurations", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Same-day shipping on in-stock orders placed before 3:30 PM EST", "Only MEAN WELL USA Authorized Repair Service Center in North America", "UL/TUV authorized configuration center for MEAN WELL modular power supplies", "Factory authorized modular configuration center for Enedo", "One of the largest power supply inventories in the USA"], "facts_used": ["Founded 1982 in Lodi, NJ -> /about-us", "Privately-held company -> /about-us", "Headquarters in Doylestown, PA -> /about-us", "Franchised distributor specializing in power supply products -> /about-us", "Same-day shipping for orders placed before 3:30 PM EST -> /about-us", "MEAN WELL USA Authorized Repair Service Center -> /about-us", "UL/TUV authorized configuration center for MEAN WELL modular power supplies -> /abou