UPDATE companies SET description='Tailored Industry operates from Industry City in Brooklyn, New York. The company was founded by Alex Tschopp, who serves as CEO, and a co-founder named Kady after Tschopp experienced the difficulties of small-scale manufacturing while running a collegiate wholesale business. Frustrated by high minimum orders and the scarcity of domestic knitting mills, Tschopp began producing sweaters in-house, eventually pivoting to offer low-minimum, quick-turnaround knitwear production to other brands.

The factory specializes in on-demand knitwear manufacturing using 3D whole-garment knitting machines that produce zero-waste garments without cutting or sewing. Starting with four machines in a 500-square-foot space at the Brooklyn Army Terminal, the operation has expanded into a larger facility at Industry City. The company maintains a library of over 300 market-ready styles and offers three service tiers: Boutique for ready-to-sell items with drop shipping in three to nine business days, Studio for customized silhouettes and details, and Flagship for full custom development. A proprietary platform integrates with Shopify to provide real-time production tracking and fulfillment.

Tailored Industry serves fashion brands, apparel companies, and merchandise programs of all sizes. Clients have included Porsche Brooklyn for branded merchandise, Oliver Charles for fashion knitwear, Tigerbob for custom colorful knits, and Ministry of Supply for built-to-order production. The company targets both emerging labels and established brands seeking domestic production without inventory risk.

The business was built to eliminate the traditional barriers of high minimums, long lead times, and opaque supply chains. Its stated differentiators include a nine-business-day order-to-launch window, zero-waste manufacturing, domestic automated production, and a team with over 100 years of combined knitwear experience.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["On-demand knitwear manufacturing", "3D whole-garment knitting", "Automated knitting production", "Finishing and quality control", "Custom knitwear development", "Silhouette and fit customization", "Embroidery", "Yarn-stock service", "Shopify integration for production tracking", "Drop shipping fulfillment", "Zero-waste manufacturing (no cutting, no sewing)"], "industries": ["Fashion brands", "Apparel companies", "Merchandise programs", "Knitwear", "Custom merchandise", "Small batch production"], "materials": ["Eco-Viscose", "Cotton", "Merino", "Cashmere", "Sorona"], "equipment": ["3D whole-garment knitting machines"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "9 business days for order to launch", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Zero minimum order quantities", "Order to launch in 9 business days", "300+ ready-to-sell styles in STK library", "Seamless Shopify integration with real-time tracking", "Zero-waste, no-cut, no-sew 3D knitting"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Brooklyn, New York -> db", "Founders Alex Tschopp (CEO) and Kady -> /about", "Founded after challenges in small-scale manufacturing -> /about", "On-demand knitwear manufacturing using 3D whole-garment machines -> /about, /", "Zero-waste, no cutting, no sewing -> /about", "Started with 4 machines in 500 sq ft at Brooklyn Army Terminal -> /about", "Expanded to Industry City facility -> /about", "300+ market-ready styles in STK library -> /", "Three service tiers: Boutique, Studio, Flagship -> /", "Shopify integration for real-time tracking -> /, /about", "9 business day order-to-launch -> /", "Drop shipping in 3-9 business days -> /", "Clien