UPDATE companies SET description='Taiyo America Inc. operates from Carson City, Nevada, where it was established in 1990 as the manufacturing subsidiary of Japan''s Taiyo Holdings Co., Ltd. (founded 1953). The company began as a supplier of solder mask products and has since expanded its portfolio to serve the printed circuit board industry across North America and Europe.

The company produces a range of electronic materials including the PSR-4000 family of liquid photoimageable solder masks, legend inks, thermal management inks, direct imaging products, hole-plugging and gap-filling compounds, and dielectric and conductive inks for printed electronics. It also designs and manufactures PCB coating and drying equipment under the Taiyo Circuit Automation brand. Processes supported include screen printing, spray coating, curtain coating, inkjet deposition, and UV LED curing (360–420 nm).

Taiyo America serves aerospace and defense, medical, automotive, and consumer electronics sectors. Its materials have been qualified for programs such as the F-35 fighter jet, the Mars MER-1 rover, the X-59 Quesst X-plane, and satellite platforms. In medical devices, they are used in hearing aids, blood pressure monitors, imaging equipment, and robotic systems. Automotive applications include electric vehicles, brake systems, vacuum pumps, and LED lighting. Consumer electronics encompass smartphones, smartwatches, laptops, tablets, and desktop computers.

The company emphasizes three differentiators: a proven track record as the global market leader in specialty inks and solder masks; service delivered by regional sales, engineering, and support teams across North America and Europe; and innovations driven by heavy R&D investment, exemplified by the high-resolution FLEXFINER dry film, inkjet solder masks, and next-generation thermal management products. Taiyo also notes that in-stock items typically ship by the end of the next business day.', certifications=ARRAY['UL LISTED','ROHS']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Screen printing", "Spray coating", "Curtain coating", "Inkjet printing", "UV LED curing (360\u2013420 nm)", "Dry film lamination", "Hole plugging", "Gap filling", "Legend ink application (inkjet, screen, spray)", "PCB coating equipment manufacturing", "PCB drying equipment manufacturing", "Thermal management ink formulation", "Dielectric ink formulation", "Conductive ink formulation", "Direct imaging", "Photoimageable solder mask processing (two-component)", "Conductive silver hole fill (single-component)", "UV curable hole fill (single-component)", "Thermal curable solder mask (two-component)", "UV curable solder mask (single-component)", "UV curable touch-up ink"], "industries": ["Aerospace and Defense", "Medical", "Automotive", "Consumer Electronics", "Printed Electronics", "Lighting and Display"], "materials": ["Photoimageable solder mask (two-component)", "Conductive silver hole fill (single-component)", "UV curable hole fill (single-component)", "Thermal curable solder mask (two-component)", "UV curable solder mask (single-component)", "UV curable touch-up ink", "Legend inks (inkjet, screen, spray)", "Thermal management inks", "Dielectric inks", "Conductive inks", "Dry film photoresist (FLEXFINER)"], "equipment": ["Taiyo Circuit Automation PCB coating and drying equipment", "UV LED curing system (360\u2013420 nm)", "FLEXFINER dry film solder mask line"], "volume": "", "lead_time": "Next business 