UPDATE companies SET description='Tampa Metal Works operates from Tampa, Florida, where it has served commercial clients across the state for nearly 40 years. The company is locally owned and operated, though no founding year or individual founders are disclosed.

The shop provides custom metal fabrication, in-house manufacturing, field welding, and on-site installation, along with prompt delivery of finished components. Its product line includes scuppers, downspouts, collector boxes, chimney caps, and handrails, all formed from brake metal and flat stock held in inventory to support quick turnaround.

Primary customers are roofing and sheet-metal contractors on commercial construction projects. Tampa Metal Works services Hillsborough, Pinellas, Pasco, Polk, Manatee, Hardee, Highlands, Sarasota, and DeSoto counties, and offers nationwide shipping for orders outside its core region.

The company emphasizes its understanding of contractor schedules, citing a broad in-stock flat-stock inventory and reliable delivery as key differentiators. It operates under a Florida roofing contractor license (CCC1329561), holds memberships in the Florida Roofing and Sheet Metal Contractors Association and the National Roofing Contractors Association, and follows SMACNA standards for fabrication and installation.', certifications=ARRAY['Licensed Roofing Contractor (CCC1329561)','Florida Roofing and Sheet Metal Contractors Association (FRSA) member','National Roofing Contractors Association (NRCA) member','SMACNA standards']::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Custom metal fabrication", "In-house manufacturing", "Field welding", "On-site installation", "Prompt delivery", "Drainage solutions", "Downspout fabrication", "Collector box fabrication", "Scupper fabrication", "Chimney cap fabrication", "Brake metal forming", "Handrail fabrication"], "industries": ["Commercial construction", "Roofing", "Sheet metal", "Contractors"], "materials": ["Brake metal", "Flat stock"], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Flat-stock inventory for fast turnaround", "Dependable delivery services", "In-house fabrication and on-site installation", "Licensed roofing contractor (CCC1329561)", "Adherence to SMACNA standards"], "facts_used": ["Tampa, Florida location -> db", "Nearly 40 years of service -> /about-us", "Locally owned and operated -> /about-us", "Custom fabrication, installation, delivery services -> /", "In-house manufacturing of scuppers, downspouts, handrails -> /", "Field welding and on-site installation -> /", "Prompt delivery services -> /", "Warehousing flat stock inventory for fast turnaround -> /", "Licensed Roofing Contractor CCC1329561 -> /", "FRSA member -> /", "NRCA member -> /", "Follows SMACNA standards -> /", "Service areas: Hillsborough, Pinellas, Pasco, Polk, Manatee, Hardee, Highlands, Sarasota, DeSoto counties -> 