UPDATE companies SET description='Teets Cattle Company operates from Lost River, West Virginia, where Matt and Jill Teets run the family farm alongside their sons Justin, JW, and Jordan. The business centers on raising cattle and crops on their own land, following a straightforward approach the family describes as "simple is best." No founding year is publicly stated.

