UPDATE companies SET description='Tekin, Inc. operates from McCall, Idaho, where it designs and manufactures electronic speed controls, motors, servos, batteries, and connectors for radio-controlled vehicles.

Its product line spans multiple categories: the RX8 GEN3 and RSX PRO electronic speed controls for 1:8-scale and modified racing; the RS GEN3 and BXR compact ESCs for crawling and general use; the RX4 rock-racing controller; brushless motors such as the TYPE-D drag motor, Eliminator series, GEN4 and GEN4 SPEC-R lines; brushed crawler motors; Tekin servos with aluminum housings and magnetic encoding; POWER CELL LiHV batteries in 1S–4S configurations; and the proprietary Pro-Lock bullet connectors with a tool-less locking mechanism. The firm also develops the HotWire programming device and firmware for ESC tuning.

Tekin serves competitive racers and hobbyists across several RC disciplines. Its equipment is used in 1:8-scale circuit racing, no-prep drag racing, rock crawling, scale trail driving, and custom adventure builds. The company references top drivers choosing the RX8 GEN3 and drag racers pairing Eliminator motors with V295 firmware.

The company emphasizes a ''built for racers by racers'' philosophy, highlighting its proprietary Pro-Lock connector locking mechanism, Active Drag technology for smooth throttle control, Element Proof designs that withstand weather, and Ultra-Low Resistance (ULR) motor windings for higher output. These features are presented as the core differentiators behind its Real Racing Gear branding.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["Electronic speed control (ESC) design and manufacturing", "Brushless motor design and manufacturing", "Brushed motor design and manufacturing", "Servo design and manufacturing", "LiHV battery pack assembly", "Bullet connector manufacturing", "Firmware development and ESC programming (HotWire)", "Custom RC vehicle builds and content production"], "industries": ["Radio-controlled (RC) circuit racing", "RC drag racing (no-prep)", "RC rock crawling and scale trailing", "Scale modeling and custom RC builds", "RC hobby and enthusiast market"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["Proprietary internal locking mechanism on Pro-Lock bullet connectors", "Built for racers by racers design philosophy", "Active Drag technology for throttle and brake control", "Element Proof construction for all-weather durability", "Ultra-Low Resistance (ULR) motor winding technology"], "facts_used": ["Company name: Tekin, Inc. -> db", "Headquarters: McCall, Idaho -> db", "Product lines: ESCs, motors, servos, batteries, connectors -> page /", "Industries: RC racing, drag racing, crawling, scale modeling -> page /", "Differentiators: Pro-Lock locking mechanism, Active Drag, Element Proof, ULR -> page /", "No founding year, ownership, founders, employee count, certifications, equipment, materials, volume, lead time, tolerances, CAGE code, min order, export compliance, languages, social links found in INPUT -> db and page /"], "company_type": "Manufacturer", "makes_products": "yes", "type_evid