Texas Kings Textile serves an international buyer network spanning Latin America, Africa, Asia, and the Middle East. Named destinations include Bolivia, Chile, the Democratic Republic of Congo, Liberia, Burkina Faso, Ghana, Zambia, Sharjah, Thailand, the Philippines, Cambodia, Guinea, Cameroon, Nigeria, Malawi, Senegal, Mali, and Jordan.

