UPDATE companies SET description='The Tri-M Group, LLC is headquartered in Kennett Square, Pennsylvania, with additional offices in Lock Haven, Quakertown, Middletown (Delaware), and Baltimore (Maryland). The company was founded in 1964 by brothers Tom and Dick Musser as a small industrial and commercial electrical contractor.

Today Tri-M employs over 500 people and provides design, installation, and ongoing service for high-voltage electrical construction, building automation systems, data and telecommunications networks, security solutions, and energy analytics. The company operates a panel fabrication shop and offers 24/7/365 emergency and scheduled maintenance, remote engineering support, and a proprietary online project tracking tool called ProNav.

Tri-M serves industrial and commercial clients across the Mid-Atlantic region, including facilities that require energy benchmarking, building automation upgrades, secure network infrastructure, and high-voltage electrical work.

The firm emphasizes a culture rooted in safety, ethical decision-making, collaborative problem-solving, and superior service delivery. Leadership states that the ESOP structure was chosen to preserve the company’s independence, retain its workforce, and continue the legacy of founder Tom Musser, who believed in giving back to the community and empowering employees.', certifications=ARRAY[]::text[], profile='{"capabilities": ["24/7/365 service", "Emergency service", "Scheduled maintenance", "Flexible service contracts", "Building automation services", "Security system services", "Preventative maintenance", "Hardware/software replacement & service", "Remote engineering services", "Network infrastructure services", "Service & repair", "Service upgrades & replacements", "Panel fabrication", "Electrical construction", "High voltage installation", "Safety services", "Customer training", "Project management (ProNav)"], "industries": ["Commercial", "Industrial", "Energy management", "Building automation", "Security systems", "Telecommunications"], "materials": [], "equipment": [], "volume": "", "lead_time": "", "tolerances": "", "built_on": ["100% employee-owned via ESOP", "24/7/365 emergency and scheduled service", "ProNav online project tracking tool", "In-house panel fabrication", "Remote engineering support"], "facts_used": ["Headquarters in Kennett Square, PA with offices in Lock Haven, Quakertown, Middletown DE, Baltimore MD -> db", "Founded 1964 by Tom & Dick Musser -> /about", "Transition to 100% employee ownership via ESOP -> /about", "Over 500 employees -> /about", "Services: design, installation, service of high voltage, electrical construction, building automation, data/telecom networks, security, energy analytics -> /", "Panel fabrication capability -> / (capabilities)", "24/7/365 emergency and scheduled service -> / (capabilities)", "ProNav project navigation tool -> /", "Core values and mission statement -> /about", "Industrial and commercial electrical contr