UPDATE companies SET description='The Wood Factory operates from Winterport, Maine, where it has dedicated itself to producing historically accurate millwork at an affordable price.

The shop specializes in Victorian gingerbread treatments, reproducing designs painstakingly researched from turn-of-the-century catalogues, photographs, and architectural drawings. In addition to its catalog of historical patterns, the company offers custom matching services, working from customer sketches, photographs, architects'' renderings, and original samples sent to the facility. The operation includes an online shop and a custom work division, though facility size, headcount, and annual volume are not disclosed.

